<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
</head>
<body xml:lang="en" style="margin:0;width:100%;height:100%;padding:0;word-break:break-word;"><div role="article" aria-roledescription="email" lang="en" dir="ltr" style="background-color:#f2f1ef;font-family:'Zalando Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:max(16px,1rem);">
<div style="margin:0 auto;max-width:560px;padding:24px;color:#151515;">
<div style="padding:16px 4px;"><p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:28px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:#151515;">Ogen</p></div>
<div style="border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #e0deda;background-color:#fffffe;padding:40px 32px;">
[[ if eq .Stage "action_required" ]]
<h1 style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:26px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;color:#151515;">Reconnect your [[ .Platform ]] account</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#57534d;">Hi [[ .Name ]],</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#57534d;">The connection to your [[ .Platform ]] account <strong>[[ .AccountName ]]</strong> in <strong>[[ .WorkspaceName ]]</strong> needs to be reconnected. Until then, scheduled posts to this account won't publish and its analytics won't update.</p>
[[ else ]]
<h1 style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:26px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;color:#151515;">Your [[ .Platform ]] connection expires soon</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#57534d;">Hi [[ .Name ]],</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#57534d;">The connection to your [[ .Platform ]] account <strong>[[ .AccountName ]]</strong> in <strong>[[ .WorkspaceName ]]</strong> is about to expire[[ if .ExpiresIn ]] <strong>[[ .ExpiresIn ]]</strong>[[ end ]][[ if .ExpiresAt ]] (on [[ .ExpiresAt ]])[[ end ]]. Reconnect it now so your scheduled posts keep publishing without interruption.</p>
[[ end ]]
<div style="margin:0 0 24px;">
<a href="[[ .ReconnectURL ]]" style="display:inline-block;border-radius:4px;background-color:#151515;padding:12px 24px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#fffffe;text-decoration:none;">Reconnect [[ .Platform ]]</a>
</div>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#8a857d;">Or paste this link into your browser:<br><a href="[[ .ReconnectURL ]]" style="color:#57534d;word-break:break-all;">[[ .ReconnectURL ]]</a></p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#8a857d;">Reconnecting takes a few seconds and re-authorizes Ogen to keep posting on your behalf.</p>
</div>
<div style="padding:24px 4px;"><p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#8a857d;">— The Ogen team</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
